"P4060977254" "You finally 'persuade' someone in Longbow to talk to you like a civilized person. They tell you that their platoon leader, Officer Martins, was boasting that they were going to win it big at the Hook and Anchor card tournament thanks to a special card deck. The tournament is going on right now."

