"P2746722308" "'Persuade' Longbow on Nerva"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3361574828" "Keep at it, {HeroName}, somebody in Longbow knows something about that deck of cards."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2439212980" "You've defeated enough Longbow to tell you who bought the deck and what he plans to do with it."

