// Dialog :
"P929688389" "Excellent job, {HeroName}! I should have figured that that miscreant, Darrin Wade, would be involved with my stolen artifacts. Let me see the deck.<br><br>Hmmm, the magical aura is... strange. Wait a minute. What in the world?! This deck is a FAKE!<br><br>Gah! I knew Darrin was a jerk, but selling fake magic items is an all new low, even for him! If that bloody scoundrel made a fake of the deck, then he probably kept the real one for himself."
// RandomFameString :
"P430712295" "I heard {VillainName} bounced some Longbow officer out of the Hook and Anchor for cheating. I didn't even know {VillainName} worked there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4201504086" "Alright, I'm really pissed off, {HeroName}. Leave it to Darrin Wade to get under my skin like this.<br><br>I want to hire you again. <color orange>This time I need you to go talk to Darrin Wade</color> and make it crystal clear that if he doesn't return the REAL Dead Man's Deck, then you'll bust up that handsome face of his.<br><br>As far as I'm concerned, the gloves are off between us. You can find his skinny butt on <color deepskyblue>Sharkhead Isle</color>."
// AcceptString :
"P3423244590" "Talk to Darrin Wade"
// SendOffString :
"P4267420210" "I bet this is some sort of petty revenge plot of Darrin's to punish me for joining the Midnight Squad. Whatever, the past is the past, and right now, he is on my bad side. His loss."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P437020894" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1154461616" "Talk To Darrin Wade"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P689340440" "You need to talk to Darrin Wade, because I would probably kill him if I saw him right now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1145154934" "<color deepskyblue>The Dead Man's Deck<br>Part Three<br><br></color>Ah, how is Mercedes? Still fussing over her 'private collection'?<br><br>I assume she wants her Dead Man's Deck back. Well, as you already know, I sold a fake to that poor Longbow officer. I usually don't make a business out of selling fakes, but seeing as how Hector never got me the items I requested, and I had standing orders for those items, I had to do what I had to do. So, I cast a slight glamor on a normal deck of playing cards and sent that Longbow fool off to get busted by the casino.<br><br>Honestly, the idiot was doomed to fail from the beginning. The house always wins, ALWAYS. It wouldn't matter even if you had the real Dead Man's Deck.<br><br>If you want to know where the real deck is, you're going to have to do some leg work because I, sadly, don't have it. Hector, in his infinite wisdom, presented it to the <color red>Carnival</color> as some sort of peace offering. Obviously that didn't work out as well as he'd planned.<br><br><color orange>At any rate, I heard the Carnival in possession of the deck is doing a show over in Paragon tonight. Perhaps you should consider a night out on the town.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4168556814" "If Darrin says that's where the deck is, then you should check it out. I don't think he's stupid enough to cross both of us."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1397332402" "You snuck onto a cargo ship bound for Paragon City, kept to the alleys and now you're ready to face the Carnival and retrieve the Dead Man's Deck."

