"P3821273281" "Return to Darrin Wade"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1063061680" "You should finish your business with Darrin before talking to me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3490331979" "<color deepskyblue>The Dead Man's Deck<br>Finale<br><br></color>You found the deck, so why are you coming back to see me?<br><br>Oh, I see, you figure I might outbid Ms. Sheldon on it. No thank you, I don't need the ire of that woman anymore than I already do. I guess that means you should be a good little lackey and take it back to her. But then again, why should you?<br><br>The Midnight Squad wants to hide the power of the deck from the world. What a waste. Since I have a vested interest in keeping that from happening, I'll fill you in on a little secret. The one card in this deck that really matters, is this one. The Ace of Spades.<br><br>You should take it for yourself. Personally, I doubt she'll even notice that it's gone until long after you deliver it back to her, assuming you replace it with something suitably convincing, like this card here.<br><br>There, I wash my hands of this mess. Good luck with the whole Midnighter thing, and if you ever change your mind, just come and see me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1331777989" "Please tell me that Darrin acted like a phenomenal scumbag and you had to rearrange his face. No? Pity that. I wouldn't have minded seeing that horrible chin scruff removed.<br><br>At any rate, it sounds like you had to deal with quite a bit of trouble in order to get the deck back. Are you sure that the Carnival didn't have a fake too? Good, all this back and forth has me flustered, so I can only imagine how you feel. Here is the pay I promised you, and, I have to say, I am pleased with how our arrangement worked out.<br><br>Keep in touch, I might call on you again soon."
// RandomFameString :
"P2898520960" "That Carnival show in Paragon City was cancelled because {HeroName} crippled the entire troupe over a stolen deck of playing cards."

